From 8d6f870b54db9bf6f763df128092f7581524e57c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joshua Bryan <45343084+rafe-walker@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:20:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix(plugin-mcp): respect document locks, refuse empty
 where, conflict answers, per-document bulk results in update and delete

Update and delete respect document locks by default: overrideLock defaults to false, as REST does, and delete
takes overrideLock and passes it. A refused write answers with isError and a Conflict text naming the lock
holder and the document version, with a re-read instruction; optional ifUpdatedAt precondition. An empty where
is refused unless all: true. Bulk update and delete report per document (PARTIAL headline and isError). Fields
named like operation arguments go under data. Compact write receipts (returnDocument: true for the whole
document). Tool annotations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
